    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "左歌没有说话，他跑回房间，关好门。",
      "traditional": "左歌沒有說話，他跑回房間，關好門。",
      "pinyin": "zuǒ gē méi yǒu shuō huà tā pǎo huí fáng jiān guān hǎo mén",
      "english": "Zuoge did not speak. He ran back to his room and closed the door."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "他房间的桌子上也有一个苹果，是三姐送的。",
      "traditional": "他房間的桌子上也有一個蘋果，是三姐送的。",
      "pinyin": "tā fáng jiān de zhuō zi shang yě yǒu yí ge píng guǒ shì sān jiě sòng de",
      "english": "There was also an apple on the table in his room. It was the one Sanjie gave to him."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "左歌看着苹果，现在他已经知道了，这个苹果有问题，不能吃。",
