      "pinyin": "zuǒ gē kàn zhe píng guǒ xiàn zài tā yǐ jīng zhī dào le zhè ge píng guǒ yǒu wèn tí bù néng chī",
      "english": "Zuoge looked at the apple. Now he knew that there was a problem with this apple. He couldn’t eat it."
    }
