    "sentence_translations": [
      "5. Apple",
      "",
      "Sanjie sang again: “Little tree, little tree, quickly grow tall.”",
      "",
      "Soon, there were some small black trees growing in the room.",
      "",
      "The black dwarf ran around beside the little trees. They soon grew taller, and the little trees became big trees.",
      "",
      "Sanjie sang again: “Apple, apple, red apple.”",
      "",
      "Soon, there were some little red things growing on the big trees. They were apples.",
      "",
      "What was going on? Why would trees grow inside a room? Why would red apples grow on a black tree?“",
      "Am I seeing it wrong?” Zuoge said.",
      "",
      "When Sanjie heard this, she asked, “Who? Who’s outside?”",
      "",
      "Zuoge did not speak. He ran back to his room and closed the door.",
      "There was also an apple on the table in his room. It was the one Sanjie gave to him.",
      "Zuoge looked at the apple. Now he knew that there was a problem with this apple. He couldn’t eat it."
    ]
  }
